WEBVTT

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.690
Lonely...

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:08.070
Lonely!

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:11.150
WHITE BLOOD CELL

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:11.150
I-I won't let you get past me!

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.110
Lonely... Lonely...

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.500
You'd better get out of here now.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.120
White Blood Cell?

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:30.090
That sexual intercourse
just let in some gonococci!

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.550
Lonely...

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:37.010
We're lonely, see?

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:40.390
<i>Gonococci. The bacteria
that causes gonorrhea.</i>

00:00:40.390 --> 00:00:42.930
<i>It proliferates at a blistering pace,</i>

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.730
<i>and its incubation period
is short, at 2 to 9 days.</i>

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:49.400
We'll hold them off here.

00:00:49.690 --> 00:00:51.650
Get yourselves to safety right now!

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:52.780
O-Okay.

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:54.400
White Blood Cell...

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.280
Come on, let's get going.

00:01:11.590 --> 00:01:13.630
Lonely...

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:17.510
Lonely...

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:57.440
EPISODE 4:
FRONT LINE, GONOCOCCI,
AND CONFLICT

00:02:55.480 --> 00:02:57.440
Hey, Red Blood Cell...

00:02:57.440 --> 00:03:11.290
CELL

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:00.990
We heard that we've been invaded
by gonococci. Is that true?

00:03:00.990 --> 00:03:03.820
Yes. But it's not like I've actually seen them.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:08.160
I'm pretty sure that the White Blood Cells
are exterminating them now.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:11.290
Is that right?
But you'd better not let your guard down.

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.750
Since they say that gonococci multiply
at an insane speed!

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.510
Come on! Get up and do your jobs!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.090
Does this seem like a good time
to be sniveling?

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:27.140
We don't want to!
There's gonococci in this body, right?

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:29.810
PLATELETS

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:29.100
It would be so scary if they attacked us!

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.480
I don't give a damn if you're scared,
you little pieces of crap!

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:35.900
Oh, jeez!

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.070
You don't need to worry
about the gonococci.

00:03:38.900 --> 00:03:43.530
Because the White Blood Cells are fighting them
and taking care of them right now.

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:44.990
Really?

00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:48.200
But what if those White Blood Cells
end up losing?

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:53.040
Don't worry. Those White Blood Cells
are all unbelievably strong.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.750
They've rescued me
more times than I can count.

00:03:57.170 --> 00:03:59.960
So, let's put our faith in them, okay?

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.680
- Okay! Gotcha!
- Okay! Gotcha!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.390
Hey, thanks.

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:09.010
Not at all.

00:04:10.020 --> 00:04:11.730
Lonely...

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.980
Lonely...

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:17.860
What do we care if you're lonely?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.530
Lonely...

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:22.780
Lonel—

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:24.950
Lon—

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.200
Dammit, there's no end in sight!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:32.660
Lonely!

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.460
We're withdrawing for now!

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:39.460
What? But I can still fight!

00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.960
It's no good!
We're hopelessly outnumbered!

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.920
Seriously?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.850
Everyone! We're withdrawing for now
so we can regroup!

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.010
Retreat! Retreat!

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:01.730
Here's my report!

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:03.440
The 3rd Platoon has retreated!

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.910
The gonococci have advanced
to Urethra Area 2!

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:08.780
The gonococci is unstoppable.

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.240
How can they multiply so fast?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.250
Tell me what's happening.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:19.880
The gonococci are still proliferating.
They've expanded their forces further.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:25.630
The areas around the urethra and the prostrate
are about to be taken over by the gonococci forces.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.510
What are they doing on the front lines?
What's the status of the epididymis?

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:31.260
<i>It's still intact for now,</i>

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.680
<i>but at this rate, it's only a matter of time
before it falls to gonorrhea.</i>

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:41.940
Lonely... Lonely... Lonely...

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:38.770
<i>Gonorrhea.</i>

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:40.270
<i>A sexually-transmitted disease.</i>

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.780
<i>The infection rate is high,
at 30% per sexual intercourse session.</i>

00:05:44.780 --> 00:05:48.240
<i>Left untreated, it will trigger
inflammation of the epididymis.</i>

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:53.120
<i>The testes will become swollen, blocking
the sperm's pathway, potentially leading to sterility.</i>

00:05:53.410 --> 00:05:54.580
I'm scared!

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.120
It'll be fine. No need to worry.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.840
He shouldn't be having sex
when his resistance is so low!

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:05.710
This is all-out war!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.090
Summon the White Blood Cells
to the lymph node!

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.060
<i>Attention, all White Blood Cells!
Attention, all White Blood Cells!</i>

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.140
<i>You are to report to the lymph node at once.</i>

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:18.890
What's wrong?

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.650
It's no good. Stay away from here.

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:26.110
They say it's crawling with gonococci.
You'd better take the long way around.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:30.700
For crying out loud,
what are the White Blood Cells doing?

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.500
White Blood Cell...

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.500
Hey, hey!

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.250
They're covered in blood!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.420
If the White Blood Cells are here,
does that mean the bacteria's nearby, too?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:46.800
Wh-White Blood Cell!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:49.550
Were you able to drive out the germs?

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.510
Are you serious?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:56.600
Put yourselves in our shoes, will you?
We have to come through these vessels every day!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.020
Hey, knock it off!

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:03.520
It's your job as White Blood Cells to secure our
routes so we can be safe delivering oxygen, right?

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.280
He's right!
Why don't you do your jobs right?

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:08.440
Come on, protect us!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:12.990
How can you talk to us like that?
You have no idea what kind of battle we're—

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:17.240
Sorry. We're heading back to the lymph node
to come up with a strategy as soon as possible.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.040
You can beat those gonococci, can't you?

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.500
We're going to do our best.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.300
Hey! We're not done talking!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.460
Don't run away!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:31.220
Huh? It's not like we're running away, all right?

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:32.050
Come on.

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:38.310
Listen, you were out of line.

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:43.020
Yeah, but if we run into those gonococci,
there's nothing we can do.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.730
So, we need them to do their jobs.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.240
Take the critically injured over there.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.870
Everyone able to fight
is to stand by for further orders.

00:07:55.780 --> 00:07:57.740
This will be the last showdown, huh?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.120
But...

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.000
I've returned...

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:07.000
Captain.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:08.550
So, you survived...

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:10.380
1196.

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.300
Yes. Somehow.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.430
We're in the middle of a brutal battle.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.680
You're lucky to have made it back alive.

00:08:19.850 --> 00:08:21.270
<i>Attention, White Blood Cells.</i>

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.560
<i>As I'm sure you all know,</i>

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.860
<i>this body is about to be stricken with gonorrhea.</i>

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:31.360
<i>The gonococci have invaded
the areas surrounding the urethra...</i>

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.280
<i>and are now closing in on the epididymis
where the sperm are.</i>

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.490
<i>Are we going to continue to let them
get away with such tyranny?</i>

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:39.660
No, sir!

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.000
<i>Then, put your lives in my hands!</i>

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.750
Yes, sir!

00:08:46.170 --> 00:08:49.710
<i>This is a noble battle that we'll be
waging for the sake of this body.</i>

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:54.470
<i>Put your lives on the line to annihilate
every last one of the enemy!</i>

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.180
Yes, sir!

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.850
Your job is to be at my beck and call.

00:09:07.190 --> 00:09:10.570
The higher-ups have no clue
about the front lines.

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:16.610
Here, these are your next deliveries.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.830
The urinary tract,
the bladder, the prostrate...

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.830
Huh? But those are all
in the lower body!

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.670
Yeah, well, ever since the gonococci invasion,

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:29.630
everyone's been avoiding
deliveries near the urethra.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:30.880
Hey, then, me, too—

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.920
Rookies have no refusal rights.

00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:36.970
We leave the dangerous jobs to the rookies.
That's how it's always been done.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.390
Come on.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.640
Enough of your whining!

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.680
If you have any complaints,
take them to the White Blood Cells!

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:49.360
If they would've wiped out the gonococci,
we wouldn't be in all this danger.

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:52.940
But the White Blood Cells are fighting, right?
On the front lines?

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:57.570
What else would they be doing?
The only ability they have is to fight.

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:01.280
I'll go.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.040
Oh yeah? Thank goodness
you have some sense!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:08.170
Uh, no, no, no!
I didn't say a word about going!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.210
Don't worry. He and I
will make those deliveries for sure.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:15.210
Hey! Speak for yourself!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.850
Captain, please wait.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:25.520
You...

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.100
Please take me, too.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:30.980
You dummy! You just got beaten up
by a gonococcus! You're in no shape to fight!

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:32.690
I'm all right now.

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:35.650
You should back off.
You'll only get in our way.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:38.490
You don't have to worry about me!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:41.660
Worst case scenario, I'll at least take
one or two of the gonococci down with me!

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:43.620
Captain, please!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.700
Please let me fight, too!

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.790
All of you, please listen
to what I have to say.

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.510
We're being flooded
with reports on the battle.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:01.090
Some of you may have
actual combat experience.

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.510
I know you're each putting up a good fight.

00:11:03.510 --> 00:11:10.480
However, the gonococci's proliferation speed
is far greater than our phagocytosis speed.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:14.110
In other words, gonorrhea...

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:17.690
has no chance of healing naturally!

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:21.530
Captain, does that mean...

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.620
I'll be honest with you.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:27.490
This fight...

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:30.210
is a losing battle.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:33.500
I'll be honest with you.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.000
This fight...

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:38.590
is a losing battle.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.140
Shut up!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.140
The captain isn't done talking.

00:11:53.560 --> 00:11:57.110
Even if there's no hope of winning,
we're going to go on fighting.

00:11:57.820 --> 00:12:00.860
That is the mission of those born
as White Blood Cells.

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:04.240
To devour all bacteria out of existence
with no fear of death.

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:07.450
That's our pride. But...

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.540
don't die in vain.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:14.250
There are other ways that you can be useful
to this world by surviving.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:16.790
It's a given that you'll fight valiantly.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:21.550
But when in doubt, I want you to choose
the more likely path to survival.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.220
This could very well
turn into a prolonged battle.

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:31.020
If anything happens to us,
who will protect the other cells?

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.640
For now, value that life of yours.

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.980
Understood.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.990
You're thinking that what I just said
was unbecoming of a captain, right?

00:12:43.990 --> 00:12:47.030
No. I had the same view as you.

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:53.000
TO THE URETHRA
THIS WAY

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.000
Hey, are we really going, then?

00:12:53.910 --> 00:12:55.460
You're crazy, you know that?

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:59.630
Didn't you hear that the urethra
is a hellhole of gonococci now?

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:02.670
We'll be fine. White Blood Cell
will take care of them for us.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:06.050
If White Blood Cell's job
is to drive out bacteria,

00:13:06.050 --> 00:13:09.720
then delivering oxygen to cells
is the Red Blood Cells' job.

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:14.350
No matter what the situation is,
we have to fulfill our duty!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.810
Dammit, all right.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:22.650
You've changed somehow, you know?

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.610
Like, you've gotten
kind of dependable, I guess.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:27.780
Is that so?

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:31.830
When it comes to White Blood Cell,
you totally go through this personality change.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.080
Huh? R-Really?

00:13:35.540 --> 00:13:37.170
What's this?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.210
It's the White Blood Cells!

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.470
What? Then, this is...

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:46.760
pus?

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:48.430
<i>Pus.</i>

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:52.930
<i>An opaque, viscous fluid
produced at the site of inflammation.</i>

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:59.730
<i>Composed of White Blood Cells, blood serum, etc.,
it also contains tissue debris and dead bacteria.</i>

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.860
N-No way.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:06.070
Are you okay?

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:09.070
Hey, this place is bad news!
Let's get out of here!

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.450
Lonely...

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.290
Hey, did you just say something?

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.040
No, I didn't.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:21.000
I'm lonely, see?

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:21.920
Watch out!

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:35.100
W-We have to...

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.020
hold them off.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.110
So, the gonococci have come this far.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.900
Macrophage!

00:14:44.190 --> 00:14:45.860
<i>Macrophage.</i>

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:47.740
<i>A type of White Blood Cell.</i>

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:52.120
<i>One of its duties is to clean up
dead cells and bacteria.</i>

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.740
What are you doing
in a dangerous place like this?

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.960
W-We have a delivery to make up ahead.

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:04.090
I see. If you're planning to move on,
brace yourselves.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:07.670
It's hell back there
in the arteria profunda penis.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.840
Lonely...

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.100
Lonely!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:17.060
Hold your ground!
Annihilate the enemy!

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:18.430
Devour them out of existence!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:21.850
<i>Phagocytosis or opsonic action.</i>

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:23.650
<i>The process...</i>

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:27.860
<i>by which White Blood Cells and the like engulf bacteria
and other foreign substances, and break them down.</i>

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:31.490
Lonely!

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:33.490
Unbelievable proliferation rate!

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.620
They just keep increasing
more and more!

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:50.170
<i>The cell wall's so hard!</i>

00:15:50.510 --> 00:15:52.180
<i>Cell wall.</i>

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:57.140
<i>The armor-like structure
found on the cells of plants and bacteria.</i>

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:59.140
<i>It's durable and repairs itself swiftly.</i>

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.020
<i>Unless we do something about that...</i>

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.810
<i>it will be impossible for us
to overtake their proliferation rate!</i>

00:16:06.070 --> 00:16:10.820
Hey there, White Blood Cells.
Why don't we all become friends?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:12.030
What did you say?

00:16:12.030 --> 00:16:14.030
I know all about it.

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:17.410
That the other cells are scared of you

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.660
and treat you all like outcasts.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.290
The truth is, you're lonely, aren't you?

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:24.750
Shut up!

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:32.090
Captain!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:34.130
Lonely!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.390
Hey...

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.850
let's turn back after all.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.390
I'm going to finish the job
even if I have to do it alone.

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.400
Huh? You're telling me
to turn back on my own now?

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.530
Hey, wait up, will you?

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:52.950
Lonely...

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:54.950
Lonely...

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:58.910
I'm lonely, see?

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:03.040
White Blood Cell...

00:17:05.670 --> 00:17:10.800
How pitiful is that? To be ostracized
by the other cells, to be hated by them...

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:14.470
Useless even when it comes
to your only redeeming feature, battle.

00:17:14.470 --> 00:17:19.220
And to end up in a pile of filthy pus!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.180
Run.

00:17:23.060 --> 00:17:25.390
Hurry! Run!

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:28.690
She's right. Let's get out of here.
There's nothing you and I can do here—

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:30.270
It's not dirty.

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.030
Huh?

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.360
Huh?

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:37.200
Pus is proof that the White Blood Cells
fought with their lives on the line!

00:17:37.620 --> 00:17:43.620
Even if others fear them and find fault with them,
they never say a word of complaint.

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:50.040
They go on fighting for this body. For us cells.
It's proof that White Blood Cell fought for us!

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.800
So, how could it be dirty?

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:57.800
How insolent. What can a puny
Red Blood Cell like you do?

00:17:58.090 --> 00:17:59.970
I deliver oxygen!

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:04.230
Just like White Blood Cell,
I put my life on the line to deliver oxygen!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.940
What the cell is this?

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:14.320
My cell wall is disintegrating!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:15.900
Is this...

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:17.280
I have a report!

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:20.780
It seems that an antibiotic has been delivered
from the mouth via the esophagus!

00:18:21.030 --> 00:18:22.580
Antibiotic...

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.290
Penicillin, then?

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:25.790
<i>Penicillin.</i>

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:28.040
<i>The world's first antibiotic.</i>

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:32.380
<i>Works by inhibiting bacterial cell wall synthesis.</i>

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:40.470
<i>Since penicillin only affects
bacterial cell walls,</i>

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:43.010
<i>it leaves human cells unharmed.</i>

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.350
I'm lonely.

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:49.140
I have to multiply
so I'll have more friends!

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:54.320
White Blood Cell!

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.400
Captain!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:01.320
I've got this! You protect
the Red Blood Cells and head to the back!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.490
But if we do that, you'll...

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:06.950
Let the Red Blood Cells finish their job.

00:19:07.580 --> 00:19:11.460
I want you to create a future
for this world by surviving!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:15.050
Come with us!
Captain, you should survive, too!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.880
That's what I'm planning to do. Now go!

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:23.180
We'll clear the path open.

00:19:23.180 --> 00:19:24.680
We're going to run straight through.

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:25.930
All right!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:34.690
Now that their cell walls are gone,

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:38.570
we can destroy them
faster than they can multiply.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:41.200
This is our chance to strike back!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:44.530
We're going to show them
how powerful we White Blood Cells are!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:46.490
Annihilate them!

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:53.250
Let's see it through to the end.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.250
This is...

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:59.380
the White Blood Cells' job!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:10.640
<i>We've lost scores of our friends
in today's battle.</i>

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.140
<i>Still...</i>

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:16.610
<i>thanks to your hard work,
the gonococci have been wiped out!</i>

00:20:17.190 --> 00:20:20.610
Therefore, I declare
the gonorrhea completely cured!

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:25.410
What's going to happen
to the White Blood Cells who passed away?

00:20:25.410 --> 00:20:28.040
They'll be eliminated as a pus
from the urethra.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:31.290
Captain...

00:20:35.670 --> 00:20:37.210
E-Excuse me!

00:20:38.130 --> 00:20:39.710
I'm so sorry.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:45.590
For asking if you were really doing
your job right, and mouthing off at you.

00:20:45.590 --> 00:20:47.640
That's just how it goes with work.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:48.350
What?

00:20:49.060 --> 00:20:53.810
You guys deliver oxygen,
and we exterminate germs.

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.020
There's no way for us
to cover for each other.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.940
That's precisely why we can be proud.

00:21:01.530 --> 00:21:03.400
<i>Now opening the urethra.</i>

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:11.080
<i>Life-threatening jobs...</i>

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:16.040
<i>Will we ever find it fulfilling someday?</i>

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.800
Here's the military gains report for today's battle
between the gonococci and the White Blood Cells.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.260
This is deplorable.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:30.220
Just how many casualties did they produce
going up against mere gonococci?

00:21:30.220 --> 00:21:32.390
Damn those fragile White Blood Cells!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.350
If I may, sir, I believe
the White Blood Cells put up a good fight—

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:36.440
MILITARY GAINS REPORT

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.440
You're too lenient!

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:42.360
This body's condition isn't showing an iota
of improvement because they're so pathetic!

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:48.370
No one can save it
from this crisis but us T Cells!

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.460
PREVIEW

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:25.300
Work, work, work
until you drop!

00:23:23.170 --> 00:23:24.880
OVERWORK

00:23:25.300 --> 00:23:27.420
The hair that we created...

00:23:26.550 --> 00:23:27.420
HAIR LOSS

00:23:27.420 --> 00:23:28.470
keeps falling out.

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:30.090
DELIRIUM

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:30.680
We have to do it!

00:23:30.680 --> 00:23:32.600
We have to!

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:33.970
OVERWORK, HAIR LOSS, AND DELIRIUM
